<section id="simulation" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="simulation">Simulation</h2>
<p>The state <code>y = [π, r, tp, erp]</code> follows <code>y_t = c + A y_{t-1} + u_t</code> with a diagonal <code>A</code> (AR(1) for π, r and tp; erp i.i.d. around <code>erp_target</code>). Each simulated year draws one historical year of the demeaned residuals <code>U</code> and uses the whole row. Paths start from the last observed year.</p>
<div id="12" class="cell" data-execution_count="1">
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb6"><pre class="sourceCode julia code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode julia"><span id="cb6-1"><a href="#cb6-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>c, A, vnames <span class="op">=</span> p.c, p.A, p.names</span>
<span id="cb6-2"><a href="#cb6-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>sc <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">simulate_var_bootstrapped_res</span>(c, A, vnames, U, T, n_scen;</span>
<span id="cb6-3"><a href="#cb6-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                                   y0 <span class="op">=</span> p.y0, start_year <span class="op">=</span> p.start_year, rng <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">MersenneTwister</span>(seed))</span>
