<section id="validation" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="validation">Validation</h2>
<p>One-year moments in the steady state against the historical bootstrap sample. To avoid the transient from the starting point, this check uses a separate simulation started from the unconditional mean and pools every simulated year of every path. By construction:</p>
<ul>
<li>erp has mean <code>erp_target</code> (historical mean differs by design) and the historical std, skewness and kurtosis, and no autocorrelation;</li>
<li>π, r and tp have the AR(1) unconditional moments, which match the bootstrap sample only on average (and only if the AR and bootstrap windows coincide);</li>
<li>correlations of the shocks are preserved; correlations of the levels also depend on the persistence.</li>
</ul>
<div id="32" class="cell" data-execution_count="1">
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb18"><pre class="sourceCode julia code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode julia"><span id="cb18-1"><a href="#cb18-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>ss <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">simulate_var_bootstrapped_res</span>(c, A, vnames, U, T, n_scen;</span>
<span id="cb18-2"><a href="#cb18-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                                   y0 <span class="op">=</span> <span class="op">:</span>mean, start_year <span class="op">=</span> p.start_year,</span>
<span id="cb18-3"><a href="#cb18-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>                                   rng <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">MersenneTwister</span>(seed <span class="op">+</span> <span class="fl">1</span>))</span>
<span id="cb18-4"><a href="#cb18-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>ss_nom <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">returns_from_components</span>(ss)</span>
<span id="cb18-5"><a href="#cb18-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>ss_all <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">Scenarios</span>(<span class="fu">vcat</span>(ss.data, ss_nom.data), [vnames; ss_nom.names], ss.start_year)</span>
<span id="cb18-6"><a href="#cb18-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>val_vars <span class="op">=</span> [<span class="op">:</span><span class="cn">π</span>, <span class="op">:</span>r, <span class="op">:</span>tp, <span class="op">:</span>erp, <span class="op">:</span>rf, <span class="op">:</span>rb, <span class="op">:</span>re]</span>
<span id="cb18-7"><a href="#cb18-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb18-8"><a href="#cb18-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">pooled</span>(X) <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">vec</span>(X)</span>
<span id="cb18-9"><a href="#cb18-9" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">lag1</span>(X) <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">cor</span>(<span class="fu">vec</span>(X[<span class="fl">1</span><span class="op">:</span><span class="kw">end</span><span class="op">-</span><span class="fl">1</span>, <span class="op">:</span>]), <span class="fu">vec</span>(X[<span class="fl">2</span><span class="op">:</span><span class="kw">end</span>, <span class="op">:</span>]))</span>
<span id="cb18-10"><a href="#cb18-10" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">hist_row</span>(v) <span class="op">=</span> hist_pct[<span class="fu">findfirst</span>(<span class="op">==</span>(<span class="fu">String</span>(v)), hist_pct.variable), <span class="op">:</span>]</span>
<span id="cb18-11"><a href="#cb18-11" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a></span>
<span id="cb18-12"><a href="#cb18-12" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>validation <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">DataFrame</span>(<span class="fu">map</span>(val_vars) <span class="cf">do</span> v</span>
<span id="cb18-13"><a href="#cb18-13" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    X <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fl">100</span> <span class="op">.*</span> ss_all[v]</span>
<span id="cb18-14"><a href="#cb18-14" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    x <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">pooled</span>(X)</span>
<span id="cb18-15"><a href="#cb18-15" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    h <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">hist_row</span>(v)</span>
<span id="cb18-16"><a href="#cb18-16" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    (variable <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">String</span>(v),</span>
<span id="cb18-17"><a href="#cb18-17" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>     mean_hist <span class="op">=</span> h.mean, mean_sim <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">mean</span>(x),</span>
<span id="cb18-18"><a href="#cb18-18" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>     std_hist <span class="op">=</span> h.std, std_sim <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">std</span>(x),</span>
<span id="cb18-19"><a href="#cb18-19" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>     skew_hist <span class="op">=</span> h.skewness, skew_sim <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">skewness</span>(x),</span>
<span id="cb18-20"><a href="#cb18-20" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>     exkurt_hist <span class="op">=</span> h.ex_kurtosis, exkurt_sim <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">kurtosis</span>(x),</span>
<span id="cb18-21"><a href="#cb18-21" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>     ar1_hist <span class="op">=</span> h.ar1, ar1_sim <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fu">lag1</span>(X))</span>
<span id="cb18-22"><a href="#cb18-22" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="cf">end</span>)</span>
<span id="cb18-23"><a href="#cb18-23" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="fu">show_table</span>(validation; title <span class="op">=</span> <span class="st">&quot;One-year moments: historical </span><span class="sc">$</span>(<span class="fu">span</span>(p.boot_period))<span class="st"> vs simulated steady state&quot;</span>)</span></code></pre></div><button title="Copy to Clipboard" class="code-copy-button"><i class="bi"></i></button></div>
